{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56313","headline":"咏历溪在历阳西一里 · 李聪","name":"咏历溪在历阳西一里","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"泠泠一带清溪水，远派来通历阳市。\n涓涓出自碧湖中，流入楚江烟雾里。\n（见《锦绣万花谷续集》卷十。\n）（按：《全唐诗》卷七七五收本诗，有缺文，今重录。\n诗题中〖历溪〗，《全唐诗》作「𣻕溪}\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李聪","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56313.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56313","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}